    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Social inbox unifier\n\nNative n8n port of a /build series.\nSource: https://www.allanninal.dev/build/series/social-inbox-unifier/\n\n### Where the AWS design maps to n8n\n\n| The article | Here |\n|---|---|\n| S3 document inbox | Google Sheets intake |\n| Bedrock, one read per item | OpenAI node |\n| DynamoDB tables | Google Sheets tabs |\n| SES | Gmail |\n| Lambda | this workflow |\n\nSwap any of them: Airtable or Postgres for the sheets, SMTP for Gmail, Anthropic for OpenAI. The shape is the point, not the vendor.\n\n### What does not survive the port\n\nPer-step IAM, the cost argument in part 6, and append-only writes with condition expressions. See the README."
      },
      "id": "social-inbox-unifier-note",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -220
      ]
